<div class="text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem;">Success rate</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col">
<div class="card h-100 border-0 text-center" style="border-radius: 14px;">
<div class="card-body" style="padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem;">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: .06em;">Participants</div>
<span class="material-icons" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: .75rem;">groups</span>
<div style="color: #002056; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 600; margin: .3rem 0;">1,488</div>
<div class="text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem;">Number of participants served</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col">
<div class="card h-100 border-0 text-center" style="border-radius: 14px;">
<div class="card-body" style="padding: 1.75rem 1.4rem;">
<div class="text-uppercase fw-bold" style="color: #002056; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: .06em;">Drug-Free Living</div>
<span class="material-icons" style="color: #ef3e42; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: .75rem;">bedtime</span>
<div style="color: #002056; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 600; margin: .3rem 0;">123,161</div>
<div class="text-muted" style="font-size: .9rem;">Nights of drug-free living</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- PARTICIPANT STORY -->
<section id="story" class="text-white text-center" style="background-color: #002056; border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.75rem,5vw,3.25rem) clamp(1.25rem,7vw,5.5rem);">
<div style="background-color: #ef3e42; height: 3px; margin: 0 auto 1.75rem; width: 52px;"></div>
<p class="fst-italic mb-0" style="font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.35rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.75;">"I came to Harbor Light to put back together the shattered pieces of my life. I'm grateful for this opportunity to start over and heal the broken parts of me - mind, body, and soul. It's helped me save my life in more ways than one. I've reunited with my children, my mother, and my brother, and I've found myself and my voice again through this program. Life isn't perfect, but since coming to Harbor Light, I can smile, laugh, and love myself again."</p>
<div class="text-uppercase mt-4" style="font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .14em;">— Harbor Light Participant</div>
<a class="btn btn-outline-light mt-4 d-inline-flex align-items-center" style="gap: .5rem;" href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLU6LmcJJ2_bnctDukkFd4sjqDUiV2aYsw&amp;si=wCTQzoqXxRXYSUpQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="material-icons" style="font-size: 1.25rem;">play_circle</span>Watch participant stories</a></section>
<!-- RECOVERY JOURNEY — compact timeline -->
<section id="journey">
<h2 class="text-center mb-4" style="color: #ef3e42; font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2;">From the streets to self-sufficiency. Step by step.</h2>
<ol class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-5 g-4 list-unstyled mb-0" style="background-color: #eef1f5; border-radius: 20px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: clamp(1.25rem,3vw,1.9rem);">
<li class="col d-flex flex-column align-items-start" style="gap: .6rem; min-width: 0;"><span class="fw-bold d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center flex-shrink-0" style="background-color: #ef3e42; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; font-size: .9rem; height: 36px; width: 36px;">1</span>
